(HOW TO TEST FAIRLY) Tj
0 -14 Td
(One successful demonstration does not prove high accuracy. We should repeat trials) Tj
0 -14 Td
(for every sign, record correct and incorrect predictions, and test with people and) Tj
0 -14 Td
(recording sessions not used in training. We should vary lighting, distance, camera) Tj
0 -14 Td
(angle, and signing speed. Per-sign results and a confusion matrix can show which) Tj
0 -14 Td
(signs are confused. Response time should be measured separately from accuracy.) Tj
0 -14 Td
